# suite TXMDCASH cash forecast
ok 1 - the forecast ends with return code 0 for STC
ok 2 - the run names its spool file
ok 3 - the spool line points at a CASHFCST listing
ok 4 - the run prints its counted once proof line
ok 5 - the fixture leaves one payable under an instruction
ok 6 - the forecast still ends with return code 0
ok 7 - the superseded payable is reported as superseded
ok 8 - the contractual payables exclude that open item
ok 9 - the instruction is forecast as a confirmed payment
ok 10 - the payables total counts each obligation once
ok 11 - the superseded residual is not added a second time
ok 12 - the fixture is handed back to the ledger
1..12
